1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:01,660
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

2
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:03,400
♪Makes me a little shy♪

3
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:04,980
♪When you say you love me♪

4
00:00:05,010 --> 00:00:06,860
♪It's more than I ever imagined♪

5
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,500
♪Slowly♪

6
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,130
♪Stay by my side♪

7
00:00:10,150 --> 00:00:13,360
♪Love is the warmth of everyday life♪

8
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:15,300
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

9
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:17,070
♪Makes me a little shy♪

10
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,640
♪You lean your forehead against mine♪

11
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:20,410
♪Then you keep grinning like a fool♪

12
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:22,000
♪Little by little♪

13
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:23,570
♪You come closer to me♪

14
00:00:23,590 --> 00:00:27,240
♪A warm love song plays in my ear♪

15
00:00:27,270 --> 00:00:29,680
=The One=

16
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:31,300
=Episode 4=

17
00:00:36,230 --> 00:00:37,010
(Su Residence)

18
00:00:37,030 --> 00:00:37,350
Su Yan.

19
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:41,280
Duan Cizhou.

20
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:44,840
So you set all this up
to put me on trial?

21
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:46,350
How interesting.

22
00:00:46,670 --> 00:00:47,390
Sit down.

23
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:48,920
It's been a while

24
00:00:49,150 --> 00:00:50,670
(Su Yuanzheng, Su Yan's father)
since we were all together.

25
00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:52,380
(Bai Jin, Su Yan's stepmother)

26
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:53,850
(Su Ya, Su Yan's younger sister)

27
00:00:56,670 --> 00:00:57,320
Fine.

28
00:00:58,070 --> 00:01:00,350
Let's hear your tired old lines.

29
00:01:04,070 --> 00:01:04,640
Su Yan.

30
00:01:05,350 --> 00:01:06,120
I know

31
00:01:06,680 --> 00:01:08,000
I made mistakes too.

32
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:10,310
But after all these years together,

33
00:01:10,710 --> 00:01:11,950
can't we give each other
one more chance?

34
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:13,070
Please?

35
00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:14,560
You said it yourself.

36
00:01:14,840 --> 00:01:16,000
All these years together.

37
00:01:16,510 --> 00:01:17,230
Do you really think

38
00:01:18,070 --> 00:01:18,840
there's anything left to save?

39
00:01:19,230 --> 00:01:21,280
Cizhou's already trying to make amends.

40
00:01:21,510 --> 00:01:22,640
You're the one who cheated.

41
00:01:25,310 --> 00:01:27,480
And someone even caught you
at a nightclub

42
00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:28,560
with male escorts.

43
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:30,640
What?

44
00:01:31,230 --> 00:01:33,150
Now you're trying to paint me

45
00:01:33,480 --> 00:01:34,510
as some kind of tramp?

46
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:36,430
Who sent you those photos?

47
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:37,430
Delete them.

48
00:01:41,790 --> 00:01:42,070
I...

49
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:44,040
A friend of mine secretly took them.

50
00:01:44,430 --> 00:01:44,950
But she was the one who...

51
00:01:44,950 --> 00:01:45,590
Duan Cizhou.

52
00:01:45,870 --> 00:01:47,070
My sister likes you.

53
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:49,480
Now that we're broken up,

54
00:01:49,950 --> 00:01:50,760
does she have a chance?

55
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:51,710
Enough!

56
00:01:52,950 --> 00:01:54,350
Delete these ridiculous photos,

57
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,510
and those breakup posts
on your social media.

58
00:01:56,590 --> 00:01:57,680
Delete all of it.

59
00:02:00,950 --> 00:02:01,510
Su Yan.

60
00:02:02,230 --> 00:02:03,230
A woman

61
00:02:03,790 --> 00:02:04,840
shouldn't be so headstrong.

62
00:02:05,310 --> 00:02:07,840
Know when to let things go with dignity.

63
00:02:09,030 --> 00:02:10,520
Let things go with dignity?

64
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:12,150
Like Mom did?

65
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:14,360
So dignified she killed herself
when your mistress moved in?

66
00:02:19,710 --> 00:02:20,520
Su Yan.

67
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:22,120
Your father

68
00:02:22,310 --> 00:02:23,430
only wants what's best for you.

69
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:25,680
No matter how capable a woman is,

70
00:02:26,470 --> 00:02:28,030
she's better off with a good husband.

71
00:02:28,030 --> 00:02:28,590
Shut up.

72
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:30,430
Nobody asked for your opinion.

73
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:32,630
A good husband?

74
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:34,470
You drove my mom to her death,

75
00:02:34,470 --> 00:02:35,520
and Dad still keeps mistresses

76
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:36,870
and has illegitimate kids on the side.

77
00:02:36,890 --> 00:02:37,820
You ungrateful brat!

78
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:39,030
Watch out!

79
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:57,360
Then let me make myself

80
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:58,590
perfectly clear.

81
00:02:58,910 --> 00:02:59,680
All these years,

82
00:02:59,750 --> 00:03:01,520
I've worked hard and earned my own money

83
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,680
so no one else's opinions

84
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:04,590
or demands can control me.

85
00:03:05,430 --> 00:03:06,400
My life.

86
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:07,910
My decisions.

87
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:09,710
Mine to make.

88
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:13,080
That's enough, Yuanzheng.

89
00:03:14,150 --> 00:03:14,800
Su Yan.

90
00:03:15,030 --> 00:03:16,030
I'm not your birth mother,

91
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:18,030
but we're still family.

92
00:03:18,470 --> 00:03:19,360
So hear me out.

93
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:21,560
You're already 30.

94
00:03:22,120 --> 00:03:23,710
You're too old to be acting like this.

95
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,280
Besides,

96
00:03:26,030 --> 00:03:27,360
after what happened back then,

97
00:03:28,190 --> 00:03:29,680
Cizhou never held it against you.

98
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:30,360
Shut up.

99
00:03:31,630 --> 00:03:32,240
What?

100
00:03:32,590 --> 00:03:34,190
Are we judging my past now too?

101
00:03:45,470 --> 00:03:45,870
I'm sorry.

102
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:49,080
I didn't think it'd turn out like this.

103
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:51,310
I came here today

104
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:53,400
because I wanted us back together.

105
00:03:54,310 --> 00:03:55,520
I wasn't trying to judge you.

106
00:03:56,590 --> 00:03:57,870
Let's forget everything that happened.

107
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:00,190
Pretend none of it ever happened.

108
00:04:00,910 --> 00:04:01,310
Okay?

109
00:04:03,310 --> 00:04:04,120
Duan Cizhou.

110
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:07,080
If I could start over,

111
00:04:09,030 --> 00:04:11,080
I'd never have opened up to you.

112
00:04:17,780 --> 00:04:18,800
Duan Cizhou.

113
00:04:24,420 --> 00:04:25,950
I've rehearsed this

114
00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:28,170
so many times.

115
00:04:31,580 --> 00:04:32,440
You said

116
00:04:33,550 --> 00:04:34,760
no matter what happened,

117
00:04:35,580 --> 00:04:36,960
you'd stay by my side.

118
00:04:38,270 --> 00:04:40,170
No matter how hard my past was to share,

119
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:43,930
you'd listen.

120
00:04:44,430 --> 00:04:45,180
Right?

121
00:04:46,380 --> 00:04:47,230
Of course.

122
00:04:57,030 --> 00:04:58,110
Duan Cizhou.

123
00:05:01,420 --> 00:05:02,350
When we graduated,

124
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:05,050
the most respected professor

125
00:05:06,130 --> 00:05:07,930
in our department, Professor Ge,

126
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:10,980
assaulted me.

127
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:22,830
Duan Cizhou.

128
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:25,840
You cheated and stopped touching me.

129
00:05:26,430 --> 00:05:29,000
Your ego couldn't handle it.

130
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:33,070
Yeah.

131
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:35,600
Some darkness

132
00:05:36,950 --> 00:05:38,430
has to be faced alone.

133
00:05:40,070 --> 00:05:41,920
But I've endured this for six years.

134
00:05:42,390 --> 00:05:43,560
I've had enough.

135
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:44,870
I've been trying to work through it.

136
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:45,950
Su Yan.

137
00:05:45,950 --> 00:05:47,040
I'm a man.

138
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:48,950
Knowing my girlfriend
had a past like that,

139
00:05:48,950 --> 00:05:50,830
was I wrong to struggle to accept it?

140
00:05:50,850 --> 00:05:51,550
Huh?

141
00:05:59,040 --> 00:06:00,420
=The One=

142
00:06:11,340 --> 00:06:12,120
(Su Yan.)

143
00:06:13,340 --> 00:06:14,220
(Tell me.)

144
00:06:15,070 --> 00:06:16,830
(What would make you feel better?)

145
00:06:16,860 --> 00:06:20,230
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

146
00:06:20,250 --> 00:06:23,920
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

147
00:06:23,940 --> 00:06:27,570
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

148
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:32,040
♪But you said time would make it fade♪

149
00:06:46,200 --> 00:06:49,720
♪Memories pile up, moment by moment♪

150
00:06:49,750 --> 00:06:53,080
♪One careless word brings my walls down♪

151
00:06:53,100 --> 00:06:56,530
♪I escape the past, then fall back in♪

152
00:06:56,560 --> 00:07:00,210
♪Longing twists into a hopeless knot♪

153
00:07:00,220 --> 00:07:03,950
♪Pulled by the past
till my world fades out♪

154
00:07:03,970 --> 00:07:07,520
♪I hum this song alone♪

155
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:11,060
♪Counting every fleeting moment♪

156
00:07:11,090 --> 00:07:14,890
♪Every corner still reminds me of you♪

157
00:07:14,910 --> 00:07:18,380
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

158
00:07:18,410 --> 00:07:22,220
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

159
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:25,710
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

160
00:07:25,740 --> 00:07:30,210
♪But you said time would make it fade♪
